{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And he said: For a hand is upon the throne of Yah.</b> He said: The reason for my prayer is this — that the blessed El swore that there shall be war against Amalek from generation to generation, and we are obligated to fight His war in every generation, as they said: \"Israel was commanded three things upon their entry into the Land: to appoint a king, to eradicate the seed of Amalek, and to build the Temple\" (Sanhedrin 20b). Therefore I prayed that He be my banner and my exaltation over the enemy."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:59.980259718Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}